pack institutional-opportunities
generation control-1
source_plane run5_recursive_external
source_ref campaign:reachable-capacity
note Real opportunities as data, not code. Reachability is decided by opportunity.py against live control_plane.db state -- actor verification, the proof frontier, work items. Blockers reference real subjects. Nothing here is marked reachable by assertion; the engine computes it.

opportunity fpq-reconstruction-evidence
  title Publish the FPQ reconstruction measured witness
  eligibility a deterministic golden fixture reconstructs within tolerance

blocker fpq-recon-proven
  opportunity fpq-reconstruction-evidence
  kind proof_layer
  subject model:fpq-fixture-tiny-f16
  profile fpq-v3-coord-qjl
  layer reconstruction
  detail the reconstruction layer must be proven on the fixture

opportunity acm-identity-continuity
  title Submit the ACM identity-continuity case study
  eligibility an ACM editor relationship verified for the editor profile

blocker acm-editor-verified
  opportunity acm-identity-continuity
  kind identity_verification
  subject acm-editor
  detail the editor contact must be verified, not merely asserted

blocker acm-human-submit
  opportunity acm-identity-continuity
  kind human_approval
  subject acm-submit-line
  detail a human crosses the external submit line

unlock verify-acm-editor
  removes_kind identity_verification
  removes_subject acm-editor
  action establish and verify a relationship with an ACM editor
  authorized false

opportunity bernstein-receipt-adoption
  title Bernstein adopts the result-receipt bundle (PR 3903)
  eligibility the PR verifies in the maintainer's CI

blocker bernstein-pr-merged
  opportunity bernstein-receipt-adoption
  kind human_approval
  subject bernstein-3903-merge
  detail the maintainer merges the PR

opportunity celld-upstream-series
  title Send the celld patch series upstream
  eligibility clean-room verified patches with authorization to assign IP

blocker celld-ip-authority
  opportunity celld-upstream-series
  kind authority
  subject celld-ip-assignment
  detail explicit IP-assignment authorization is required before sending

unlock authorize-celld-ip
  removes_kind authority
  removes_subject celld-ip-assignment
  action obtain explicit IP-assignment authorization
  authorized false
